<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>NineDeploy Rails starter</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; font: 18px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; background: #0b1020; color: #e6e9f2; }
      main { max-width: 34rem; padding: 2rem; }
      code { padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem; border-radius: 0.3rem; background: #1b2340; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>NineDeploy Rails starter</h1>
      <p>
        This page is a Rails view served by Puma. Add routes in <code>config/routes.rb</code> and
        controllers under <code>app/controllers</code>.
      </p>
      <p><code>/healthz</code> answers the health check the deployment waits for.</p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
